.TH FBC-JS 1 "2026-04-29" "FreeBASIC Compiler" "FreeBASIC Compiler"
.SH NAME
fbc-js \- FreeBASIC compiler driver for JavaScript/Emscripten
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbc-js
[\fIoptions\fR] \fIprogram.bas\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbc-js
invokes the FreeBASIC compiler with defaults suitable for the packaged
JavaScript/Emscripten target runtime.
.PP
Most compiler options are the same as for
.BR fbc (1).
.PP
The JS SDK includes WebAssembly archives for raylib, SDL2, SDL3, SDL2_image,
SDL2_ttf, FreeType, SQLite, libpng, libjpeg, bzip2, Expat, and zlib.
Include the corresponding FreeBASIC binding to link each library.
The driver selects Emscripten's GLFW 3 implementation when linking raylib.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Show wrapper/compiler help.
.TP
.BI -x " FILE"
Write the output file to
.IR FILE .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fbc-js-app (1),
.BR fbc (1)
